{"version":1,"content":"<p>太陽是否擁有一顆尚未被發現的伴星？加州大學伯克利分校物理學家理查德·穆勒（Richard Muller）提出的「復仇女神星」（Nemesis）假説認為，一顆低質量紅矮星可能每隔約2600萬年進入奧爾特雲，擾動其中的彗星軌道，從而引發彗星雨，並可能與地球歷史上的大規模滅絕事件存在關聯。這一理論雖然仍具爭議，但穆勒堅持認為，目前並沒有確鑿證據能夠將其排除。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587348.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.065751+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:21:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"bfeb71d1704d3aebd89d516b91cc337a1e4abb81f0d1c1b9aa371d70dd478971","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}